From: V <61495413+kelo221@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:10:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Ay::loadFile: stop the voices before freeing their ops

Voices read the source's ops as they play, and loadFile replaced them
without stopping the voices (and without freeing the old ones). loadFile
now stops the voices, frees the old ops and empties the dump first, as
TedSid's does.
---
 src/audiosource/ay/soloud_ay.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/audiosource/ay/soloud_ay.cpp b/src/audiosource/ay/soloud_ay.cpp
index a41a90b..e75e3e4 100644
--- a/src/audiosource/ay/soloud_ay.cpp
+++ b/src/audiosource/ay/soloud_ay.cpp
@@ -131,6 +131,12 @@ namespace SoLoud
 	{
 		if (aFile == NULL)
 			return INVALID_PARAMETER;
+		// Voices read the ops: stop them before the ops are freed.
+		stop();
+		delete[] mOps;
+		mOps = 0;
+		mLength = 0;
+		mLooppos = 0;
 		// Expect a file wih header and at least one reg write
 		if (aFile->length() < 34) return FILE_LOAD_FAILED;
 
